    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Grani, are you leaving? What about Miss Skadi?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, it's about time I head back to Rhodes Island for my next assignment. I'll find time to come see you. As for Skadi, she's a bit of a loner, so she left by herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "With Skadi's infamy well known around here, the bounty hunters should steer clear of this place from now on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, that's true. It might take a while for us to rebuild, but... this is the beginning of our new lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, take care. Come visit us during the next harvest season. We'll treat you to something special.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, sounds good to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh right, a messenger just brought this letter. It's addressed to Dewville, but it says here that it's for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's an envelope from Rhodes Island. They must have found me through the liaison office's directory. This place is off the grid, so that probably made it harder for everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's see here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "(To Grani: Skadi has set off for Dewville without our permission. She's not there on a mission. Be careful.)"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Good luck, Nearl)"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, tell me something I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, what are you doing, Grani?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Making a paper airplane.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island stationery is some high quality stuff. Planes like these fly a long way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
